OL,3,AMahmood to reopen scheme to resettle
OL,4,Arefugees in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FShabana Mahmood will announce the
OL,7,Freopening of a scheme to resettle
OL,8,Frefugees in the UK, as she hopes that
OL,9,Foffering "safe and legal" routes will
OL,10,Fdeter small boat crossings.
OL,12,FThe home secretary will say the UK
OL,13,Fwants to "live up to our international
OL,14,Fobligations" by helping those who are
OL,15,Ffleeing war and persecution, but the
OL,16,Fprocess must be "capped and
OL,17,Fcontrolled".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
