OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMahmood to reopen scheme to resettle
OL,4,Arefugees in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said the UK
OL,7,FResettlement Scheme (UKRS) will reopen
OL,8,Fimmediately and expects that around 25%
OL,9,Fof arrivals will be Afghan women and
OL,10,Fgirls and Palestinians.
OL,12,FConservative shadow home secretary
OL,13,FChris Philp said Mahmood was making a
OL,14,F"desperate attempt to appease" people
OL,15,Fwithin Labour who have been critical of
OL,16,Fher asylum reforms.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
